{
  "version": "2026-09-27.1",
  "_notes": [
    "Single source of truth for the menu, prices, and pricing/pickup rules. Fetched at runtime by index.html/app.js and staff/index.html/staff.js (and, later, by the server-side place-order Edge Function) — replaces the old menu.js.",
    "ANY change to a price, option, add-on, item id, option/add-on id, or rule MUST bump \"version\".",
    "Option and add-on \"id\"s are stable keys stored in customers' carts (and later sent to the server) — never rename or reuse one for a different meaning; add a new id instead. Display order is array order; a \"single\" group's FIRST option is its default.",
    "Item fields: id, name, nameEn (unused by design — all display text is Chinese-only, leave \"\"), then EITHER price OR priceThin/priceThick. priceThin/priceThick is used instead of price for items with a bread-thickness choice whose price delta isn't flat across items; priceThick: null means that item doesn't offer a thick option at all (no thickness picker is shown). modifierGroups references entries in the top-level modifierGroups by id; addons are one-off checkboxes on that item (shared category add-ons — 蛋餅類's 起司, 甜甜Der's 棉花糖 — are expanded onto every item in the category).",
    "SOURCE: transcribed from a phone photo of the physical board — see DOCS/menu-extracted.md for the full transcription notes, section-by-section add-on rules, and what's still uncertain. Re-check anything marked TODO below once the real PDF arrives.",
    "TODO: multi-column price areas were the hardest to read from the phone photo — menu-extracted.md flags 法式類 and 甜甜Der specifically as the most likely spots for a misread digit. Re-check every priceThin/priceThick pair in those two categories against the PDF once it arrives.",
    "PRICE_UNVERIFIED (TODO: verify against PDF — multi-column price, hardest to read from the phone photo): ft-01, ft-02, ft-03, ft-04, ft-05, ft-06, ft-07, sd-01, sd-02, sd-03, sd-04, sd-05, sd-06, sd-07, sd-08, sd-09",
    "modifierGroups.submarineSauce: not one of the originally-built sample groups — added because 潛艇堡 (submarine sandwich) needs a sauce choice and none of the existing groups fit.",
    "rules.pickup: open/close are Asia/Taipei local times, close exclusive (the last slot starts at close - slotMinutes). app.js applies a fixed +08:00 offset (Taiwan has no DST), so timezone must stay Asia/Taipei. perSlot is the max orders per slot passed to reserve_pickup_slot(). minLeadMinutes: earliest selectable slot is now + this, rounded up to the next slot boundary.",
    "rules.stamp: the Weekday Stamp Card's Friday free drink applies to the most expensive line whose item is in drinkCategory, discounted by min(that line's unit price, freeDrinkCap)."
  ],
